			"notes": "- Added new structures: Unfinished Overworld Gateways, Unfinished Nether Gateways, N Trials, and Geometry Sanctuaries.\n- Added the N Altar, featuring blood sacrifice and normal offering modes.\n- Added a new boss: Geometry Holder.\n- Added new axioms: Geodesic, Return, Prime Combo, and Shannon Entropy.\n- Added Prime Ingots, Collatz Trees, and other items.\n- Adjusted Lingxu equipment attributes and improved several quiz interfaces."
