			"notes": "## MathMaster 1.2.0\n\n- Added Study Notes, the Axiom Deduction Table, and Curios-based Axiom Cases.\n- Added axiom levels, passive abilities, active abilities, and a five-category radial selection menu.\n- Added six functional arithmetic and number theory axioms.\n- Added the full Lingxu armor set, Flow bonuses, and the Mental Rampage effect.\n- Added Digital Corruption for players and intelligent creatures, including related effects, potions, and death messages.\n- Added the numerical creature 8 and custom sounds for creatures 8 and 9.\n- Added self-insight functionality to the Insight Mirror.\n- Added the animated Prime Core item.\n- Added a dedicated Study Notes creative tab and an optional JEI Axiom Deduction category.\n- Added optional MadnessCore integration for Sanity costs and progression rewards.\n- Curios is now required on both the client and server.\n- Fixed interface blur, tooltip rendering, and Axiom Deduction Table layout issues."
